{"id": "86294", "name": "Complex_Quotient_1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Convert the following number into the form \\(p+qi\\) where \\(p\\) and \\(q\\) are real. Note: give your answer in the form \\(p+qi\\), in the box below. \\[ \\frac{{{CT:0}} + {{CT:1}}i}{{{CT:2}}+{{CT:3}}i}\\] [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-complex\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: the imaginary unit \\(i\\) is typed as the letter <code dir=\"ltr\">i</code> (or <code dir=\"ltr\">%i</code>), and multiplication with a star. For example <code dir=\"ltr\">3-2*i</code>.</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Multiplying the top and bottom by the conjugate of the denominator gives \\[ \\frac{\\ {{CT:0}}+{{CT:1}}i\\ }{\\ {{CT:2}}+{{CT:3}}i\\ }*\\frac{\\ {{CT:2}}-{{CT:3}}i\\ }{\\ {{CT:2}}-{{CT:3}}i\\ }= \\frac{\\ {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}i-{{CT:6}}i-{{CT:7}}i^2\\ }{\\ {{CT:8}}+{{CT:9}}i-{{CT:10}}i-{{CT:11}}i^2\\ }\\] and because \\[i^2= -1\\] \\[ \\frac{\\ {{CT:4}}+{{CT:5}}i-{{CT:6}}i-{{CT:7}}i^2\\ }{\\ {{CT:8}}+{{CT:9}}i-{{CT:10}}i-{{CT:11}}i^2\\ }=\\frac{\\ {{CT:12}}\\ }{\\ {{CT:13}}\\ }={{CT:14}}\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correctAns\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "sansr:ev(realpart(ans1),simp);\n  sansi:ev(imagpart(ans1),simp);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "EqualComAss", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "sansr", "tans": "pval", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<p>The real part of your answer is correct.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "sansi", "tans": "qval", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<p>The imaginary part of your answer is correct.</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wrong1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-T ", "feedback": "<p>Your answer is equivalent to the correct answer, but not in the required form \\(p + qi\\).</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-3-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "n1", "n2", "n3", "n4", "pval", "pvalwr", "qval", "qvalwr", "tempc", "wrong1"], "nvariants": 50}